	(descr "Waveshare ESP32-C6-DEV-KIT-N8/N16 carrier landing pattern. 55.00 x 25.40 mm board, 2x16 pads at 2.54 mm pitch, rows 21.80 mm apart, first pad 12.00 mm from the USB edge. Accepts the devkit soldered flat by its castellations or a pair of 1x16 female headers. Odd pins = row A (3V3 side), even pins = row B (TX/RX side).")
